  "title": "SunCoke Energy, Inc. Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Date",
  "summary": "LISLE, Ill.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- SunCoke Energy, Inc. (NYSE: SXC) plans to release its second quarter 2026 financial results on Thursday, July 30, 2026, before trading opens on the New York Stock Exchange. SXC will host its quarterly earnings call at 11:00 am ET on July 30, 2026. The conference call will be webcast live",
